{
  "markdown": "<!-- docx-story: body body -->\n\n<!-- docx-export:0 -->\nHarbor water-saving pilot\n\n<!-- docx-export:1 -->\nDecision: extend the pilot to Pier B on 15 October 2026. Owner: Mira. The chart is evidence, not decoration.\n\n<!-- docx-export:2 -->\n<table>\n<tr><td><!-- docx-export:3 --><!-- docx-unsupported: xw:tcPr --><!-- docx-export:4 --><p>Site</p></td><td><!-- docx-export:5 --><!-- docx-unsupported: xw:tcPr --><!-- docx-export:6 --><p>Before</p></td><td><!-- docx-export:7 --><!-- docx-unsupported: xw:tcPr --><!-- docx-export:8 --><p>After</p></td></tr>\n<tr><td><!-- docx-export:9 --><!-- docx-unsupported: xw:tcPr --><!-- docx-export:10 --><p>Pier A</p></td><td><!-- docx-export:11 --><!-- docx-unsupported: xw:tcPr --><!-- docx-export:12 --><p>120 L/day</p></td><td><!-- docx-export:13 --><!-- docx-unsupported: xw:tcPr --><!-- docx-export:14 --><p>72 L/day</p></td></tr>\n<tr><td><!-- docx-export:15 --><!-- docx-unsupported: xw:tcPr --><!-- docx-export:16 --><p>Pier B</p></td><td><!-- docx-export:17 --><!-- docx-unsupported: xw:tcPr --><!-- docx-export:18 --><p>Pending</p></td><td><!-- docx-export:19 --><!-- docx-unsupported: xw:tcPr --><!-- docx-export:20 --><p>Pending</p></td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<!-- docx-export:21 -->\nWater use before and after\n\n<!-- docx-export:22 -->\n![120 to 72 litres/day, a 40% reduction]()\n\n<!-- docx-export:23 -->\nSame chart for operations handoff\n\n<!-- docx-export:24 -->\n![120 to 72 litres/day, a 40% reduction]()\n\n<!-- docx-story: hf:rId9 header -->\n\n<!-- docx-export:25 -->\nInternal synthetic briefing — review date 12 October 2026\n\n<!-- docx-story: hf:rId10 footer -->\n\n<!-- docx-export:26 -->\nFooter constraint: budget capped at EUR 4,000.\n",
